       app name beside it. Read by expo-notifications through the meta-data in
       AndroidManifest, and by AirhopForegroundService for the mesh notice.

       Split light/dark, because the shade follows the SYSTEM theme rather than
       the app's, and a single value has to be legible on both. Airhop's ink on a light shade; its background colour on a
       dark one. -->
